WEBVTT

00:00.600 --> 00:07.000
Stubborn fool! Flog him! Beat him mercilessly until he confesses!

00:20.480 --> 00:24.000
That was roughly what transpired.

00:24.760 --> 00:32.000
Perhaps even the marriage proposal in morning court was merely a deliberate trap to lure Your Highness into ruin.

00:33.000 --> 00:38.000
Then what should we do now? If the Prince stays in prison, his life hangs by a thread!
